    "body": "Maybe look at how `gh` (GitHub CLI) does it: https://github.com/cli/cli/blob/355d28195ef1630fb97d2816a4e932fcce4b8f9f/pkg/cmd/version/version.go#L37-L46\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ gh --version \r\ngh version 2.0.0 (1980-01-01)\r\nhttps://github.com/cli/cli/releases/tag/v2.0.0\r\n```\n\nWe can put a link to the release in `--version` as well",
