    "updated_at": "2021-09-01T03:27:58Z",
    "body": "I think it's uncommon for command line programs to have built-in changelog? You can always check the releases page for changes. Having them in the program itself is only going to create unnecessary maintenance burden.\n\nHowever, we can create a dedicated page to document \"breaking changes\" or \"migration needed\", if that's what you want. ",
